// The Wear OS module is Kotlin and can read neither tokens.ts nor OKLCH, so the
// SAME generator that writes tokens.ts for the phone writes these Color values
// for the watch. Editing this file by hand re-creates the drift it exists to
// prevent: change ops/tools/gen_tokens.py and re-run
//   py -3.12 ops/tools/gen_tokens.py
// Only the DARK theme is emitted - a watch has no light mode here.

